{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>At Mount Sinai.</b> I have explained it in this pericope. And whoever has a heart to understand the secret of the world — then he will know the secret of the firstborn and the tenth. And behold, Abraham gave a tithe, and so too Jacob our father, peace be upon him. And further, I will reveal part of the secret in the passage of the second tithe, if the One who has no second helps me."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:13:02.082120178Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}